{"context":{"after":[],"before":[{"id":"seg-000079-267347d74745","source":"critical insight to separate what's"},{"id":"seg-000080-f60a6b7409af","source":"useful from what's not and to recognize"}]},"items":[{"id":"seg-000081-fd13883a78fd","source":"when AI outputs need refinement or"},{"id":"seg-000082-f18f97e9d084","source":"should be set aside entirely. Most of"},{"id":"seg-000083-f534ffa1aafa","source":"our interactions with AI involve small"},{"id":"seg-000084-ecdb10d916dd","source":"loops of description and discernment,"},{"id":"seg-000085-2fcc844ab2b7","source":"describing what we need, evaluating what"},{"id":"seg-000086-c5f99428e4f9","source":"we get, refining our request, and so on."},{"id":"seg-000087-e0ea7777ede7","source":"We'll explore this more deeply later in"},{"id":"seg-000088-3b2c9161bd86","source":"the course. Finally, there's diligence,"},{"id":"seg-000089-c9b1d176b226","source":"which focuses on responsible AI"},{"id":"seg-000090-e320c15d9be6","source":"interactions."},{"id":"seg-000091-3a0cd80bcc19","source":"For example, if you are using AI to help"},{"id":"seg-000092-0a3ba8bebc7f","source":"write job descriptions or review"},{"id":"seg-000093-165c3447ec56","source":"applications, how are you ensuring"},{"id":"seg-000094-a0015a3d3106","source":"fairness and controlling for potential"},{"id":"seg-000095-03c52b0c8a58","source":"biases? When making important decisions"},{"id":"seg-000096-234515c4ac11","source":"with AI assistance, how are you"},{"id":"seg-000097-c51b4087f016","source":"verifying the accuracy of the"},{"id":"seg-000098-fa7834f6a8e6","source":"information presented to you? Are you"},{"id":"seg-000099-37d994ae5dc2","source":"protecting sensitive data? Have you"},{"id":"seg-000100-4abc3531de1f","source":"considered how to be transparent about"},{"id":"seg-000101-36fcc8245574","source":"the involvement of AI? Are you willing"},{"id":"seg-000102-83bc64b5d731","source":"to be accountable for the AI assisted"},{"id":"seg-000103-970698330d0f","source":"work you have done?"},{"id":"seg-000104-b0bb67e52ada","source":"Diligence means taking ownership of your"},{"id":"seg-000105-9166a43bd2ae","source":"AI assisted work and being willing to"},{"id":"seg-000106-c69e26354552","source":"stand behind final products created"},{"id":"seg-000107-c7b777194746","source":"using AI. Diligence is critical for safe"},{"id":"seg-000108-4e6bf8e8758b","source":"and ethical AI"},{"id":"seg-000109-9b49b47c04d8","source":"collaboration. To recap, AI fluency"},{"id":"seg-000110-c5494021b0f0","source":"means developing practical skills,"},{"id":"seg-000111-aca827220b96","source":"knowledge, insights, and values that"},{"id":"seg-000112-7a61361566a8","source":"help you use AI effectively,"},{"id":"seg-000113-5bd80019b01c","source":"efficiently, ethically, and safely. AI"},{"id":"seg-000114-576d0594283b","source":"fluency includes four key"},{"id":"seg-000115-5c66ef8b0e61","source":"competencies. Delegation to decide when"},{"id":"seg-000116-fff25b81b98f","source":"and how to use AI, description to"},{"id":"seg-000117-887419179d8f","source":"communicate clearly with AI, discernment"},{"id":"seg-000118-e5858b6c49d1","source":"to evaluate AI outputs, and diligence to"},{"id":"seg-000119-307e0161601c","source":"use AI responsibly. What makes these"},{"id":"seg-000120-97a3b0400528","source":"competencies so valuable is that they"},{"id":"seg-000121-fd075b900e0a","source":"aren't tied to specific AI tools or"},{"id":"seg-000122-6ded08a62e08","source":"techniques that might become outdated."},{"id":"seg-000123-bb60a75b9edb","source":"Instead, they're fundamental skills that"},{"id":"seg-000124-d74ff47a965b","source":"will help you adapt and grow alongside"},{"id":"seg-000125-319375bc2c14","source":"this rapidly evolving technology."}],"output_fields":["id","translation"],"source_language":"en-orig","target_language":"zh-CN","translation_contract_version":4}
